 <div class="creative-overview">
  <header class="overview-header"><div><p class="overview-greeting">{{auth.username?auth.username+'，欢迎回来':'欢迎回到创作空间'}}</p><h1>把想法，变成作品。</h1><p>从一句文案开始，完成你的下一条数字人视频。</p></div><span class="overview-date">{{new Date().toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{month:'long',day:'numeric',weekday:'long'})}}</span></header>
  <div class="overview-top-grid">
